partcad-repo-ikea
=================

This PartCAD package serves IKEA products as PartCAD parts, each an alias of a
model of it in one of PartCAD's model-site collections.

The code in this repository (the `ikea_repo.py` repository plugin, the PartCAD
configuration, the catalog, the sample rooms, the tools and the tests), the
floor plans, the floor texture and the rendered pictures are:

    Copyright 2026 PartCAD
    Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0 (see LICENSE).

No model is included in this repository. Models, their metadata and their files
are fetched on demand from the model sites by PartCAD's collections of them,
and remain under their own terms and licences, as each model states them.

